<DetailLayout
  title="Shanghai Tower — The Highest View in the World"
  subtitle="At 632 metres, Shanghai Tower is China's tallest building and home to the world's highest observation deck. Here is what the RMB 180 ticket actually gets you, when to go, and how to beat the queues."
  description="Complete Shanghai Tower guide: observation deck prices and hours, how to get there by Metro, best time to visit for clear views, ticket booking tips, and what to expect on the 118th floor."
  image="/images/shanghai/shanghai-tower.webp"
